 class="label">ENTITY OBSERVATION</span><h3>Homeland Security Department</h3><p><strong>Mentions:</strong> 2</p><p><strong>Lanes:</strong> federal-register-policy</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">ENTITY OBSERVATION</span><h3>Health and Human Services Department</h3><p><strong>Mentions:</strong> 2</p><p><strong>Lanes:</strong> federal-register-policy</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">ENTITY OBSERVATION</span><h3>Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services</h3><p><strong>Mentions:</strong> 2</p><p><strong>Lanes:</strong> federal-register-policy</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">ENTITY OBSERVATION</span><h3>Appellate Division of the Supreme Court of the State of New York</h3><p><strong>Mentions:</strong> 2</p><p><strong>Lanes:</strong> courtlistener-court-records</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">ENTITY OBSERVATION</span><h3>Nuclear Regulatory Commission</h3><p><strong>Mentions:</strong> 1</p><p><strong>Lanes:</strong> federal-register-policy</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">ENTITY OBSERVATION</span><h3>Management and Budget Office</h3><p><strong>Mentions:</strong> 1</p><p><strong>Lanes:</strong> federal-register-policy</p></article></div></section><section id="figure-source-status" class="section wrap source-status-panel"><h2>Figures & Sources</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card redline"><span class="label">Figures on this page</span><h3>Checked: 25 June 2026</h3><p>Numbers on this page are public-record leads. Crime, migration, sexual-offence, payout, death, and crisis figures must be tied to named official, court, police, parliamentary, regulator, or reputable source records before they are presented as settled.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">Evidence standard</span><h3>What counts as a usable figure?</h3><p>Official statistics, court records, ministry releases, police datasets, parliamentary material, regulator data, or clearly 